# Build-context hygiene for any Dockerfile built from the repo root (the classic builder
# reads only this file; BuildKit prefers <Dockerfile>.dockerignore, e.g. service/Dockerfile.dockerignore).
# Never send secrets, dependencies or build output to the daemon.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/data
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
.git
contracts/artifacts
contracts/cache
contracts/types
contracts/coverage
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
.npm-install.lock
.secrets
**/.secrets
